     "$type": "app.bsky.feed.post",
     "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:55:32.000Z",
     "text": "To calibrate you all on which reasoning effort to use for Astra, know that GPT-6 Astra on low performs better than GPT-5.6 Sol on high.\n\nIf you were using high reasoning efforts with Sol and were happy, I suggest you move down to low or medium for Astra."
